WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.563
Advanced SQL is mostly about controlling
intermediate results and row context A

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:12.097
CTE gives a meaningful name to a stage in the query
A window

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:19.023
function lets one row see related rows without
automatically collapsing the result Sequence

00:00:19.036 --> 00:00:24.749
functions depend on a meaningful order And
throughout the module grain

00:00:24.776 --> 00:00:30.484
still matters At every stage you should be able to
complete the sentence

00:00:30.695 --> 00:00:32.208
one row represents what
